By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install Red Hat OpenShift Service Mesh on OpenShift Container Platform using the OpenShift CLI
Create and configure a Service Mesh Control Plane (SMCP)
Verify the installation status and ensure all components are running correctly
Understand the core components of OpenShift Service Mesh architecture
Navigate the service mesh operator installation process
